text:
this is really good. a few things:

1. I still feel the stiff/rigid neck doesn't look right. especially obvious in the beat where we first focus on her from the front, around seconds 4-5 in the clip, adn then at the end seconds 15-18. I really think we need to address this. her neck and chest look like a rigid block right now. like shouldn't the neck show more flex?
2. I think the recognition of danger expression needs to bit a tad more exaggerated.&#x20;
3. I think the word I was looking for the last time when I said the last the the checkpoint should be formidable is menacing. I think it needs to look menacing. also, the mounted guards are not perceptible. Maybe we bring them forward a bit from the barrier? and make them a bit bigger?
4. the horse's mane still looks stiff.&#x20;
5. also, take another look at the behaviour of the tail. something feels off about it.
